flowchart TB
 C[Customer] --> UI[ATM User Interface]
 UI --> CR[Card Reader]
 UI --> PIN[PIN Authentication]
 PIN --> BS[Bank Server]
 BS --> AUTH[Authentication Service]
 AUTH --> DB[(Bank Database)]
 BS --> TP[Transaction Processing]
 TP --> DB
 TP --> CD[Cash Dispenser]
 TP --> RP[Receipt Printer]
 CD --> C
 RP --> C
